  "title": "Qt: Don't select and scroll to packets twice",
  "description": "PacketList::goToPacket calls cf_goto_frame, which only succeeds\nif packet_list_select_row_from_data succeeds. The latter\nfunction already clears and selects the current row and scrolls\nto it at the center. We don't need to find the row number a\nsecond time, select and scroll to it again. Do select the hfid\nif we're going to a different one (e.g., selected from the\nexpert info dialog - note that 0 is a valid hfid in 4.2 and\nearlier, but not anymore.)\n\nAlso remove a comment that hasn't been true for years.",
